{
  "description": "WireMock mappings for examples/connections/servicenow-table.connection.json (docs/build/S130). Load them with 'java -jar wiremock-standalone.jar --root-dir <dir>' after copying its mappings to <dir>/mappings/, or programmatically; bind the connection to http://localhost:<port>/servicenow. Bodies follow the default ServiceNow data model and are illustrative. ServiceNowFixturesTest runs the example operations against these mappings.",
  "mappings": [
